                "headline": "Small Craft Advisory issued July 24 at 8:06PM PDT until July 25 at 5:00AM PDT by NWS Seattle WA",
                "description": "* WHAT...West winds 15 to 25 kt.\n\n* WHERE...Central U. S. Waters Strait Of Juan De Fuca and East\nEntrance U. S. Waters Strait Of Juan De Fuca.\n\n* WHEN...Until 5 AM PDT Saturday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.",
